n最近終於有機會入座吃看看！我們點了麻辣和醬油豚骨（也只有兩種口味）這裡使用點餐機先點餐付費，然後就可入座等待餐點，其麵同種口味不同麵量價格皆相同👍不過加料要另外收費的\n\n在用餐時，店員會時不時請問要不要加麵？我覺得蠻禮貌貼心的，還會請問份量、硬度，加麵是可以“無限量的”但不可加湯，我是吃多少加多少不要浪費🤤\n\n店內還有免費綠豆湯🧊挺好喝的～麵體則是口感偏軟、湯頭兩種喝起來都濃郁且偏甜（麻辣也不會很辣👍）還有加蔥真的加超多，蠻爽的🤣🤣🤣有機會要再來吃",null,[0,18]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/6837063209098378157/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVKTkZaNlNtbGxXRnBHWTBaTmQxZHJOWEppTVU1eFlqQjNOVlp1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6837063209098378157/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVKTkZaNlNtbGxXRnBHWTBaTmQxZHJOWEppTVU1eFlqQjNOVlp1WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/6837063209098378157/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVKTkZaNlNtbGxXRnBHWTBaTmQxZHJOWEppTVU1eFlqQjNOVlp1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6837063209098378157/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVKTkZaNlNtbGxXRnBHWTBaTmQxZHJOWEppTVU1eFlqQjNOVlp1WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/6837063209098378157/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVKTkZaNlNtbGxXRnBHWTBaTmQxZHJOWEppTVU1eFlqQjNOVlp1WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/6837063209098378157/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjVKTkZaNlNtbGxXRnBHWTBaTmQxZHJOWEppTVU1eFlqQjNOVlp1WXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,3767,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25JNFZ6SmllWFpGY0ZNd1drNXJiMU5xYjB3NVZuYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xf7dd0f0d8a8473a7!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOnI4VzJieXZFcFMwWk5rb1Nqb0w5Vnc%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25JNFZ6SmllWFpGY0ZNd1drNXJiMU5xYjB3NVZuYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25JNFZ6SmllWFpGY0ZNd1drNXJiMU5xYjB3NVZuYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25JNFZ6SmllWFpGY0ZNd1drNXJiMU5xYjB3NVZuYxILMGRtb2lmaFdLZkYaPg